'''Ghost''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 50th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made up of a large blue ghost in which fades to black by the heel, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia== 
*It has a [[Ghost (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ghost_Set Ghost Set].

